Return the sfSymbolsName for a given button on a gamepad on Apple platforms.

It is safe to call this function from any thread.

=over

=item gamepad - SDL3::Gamepad object or undef. the gamepad to query.

=item button - integer. a button on the gamepad.

=back

Returns string: the sfSymbolsName or NULL if the name can't be found.

Since: This function is available since SDL 3.2.0.

